OL,3,GNEWSAElection observers saw 'amazing
OL,4,Asense of civic duty'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThose who ran last week's Isle of Man
OL,7,Fgeneral election showed an "amazing
OL,8,Fsense of civic duty", the head of a
OL,9,Fteam of observers has said.
OL,11,FDeputy Chris Blinn, from Guernsey, led
OL,12,Fthe Commonwealth Parliamentary
OL,13,FAssociation British Islands and
OL,14,FMediterranean Region (CPA BIMR)
OL,15,Fobservation mission for Thursday's
OL,16,FHouse of Keys election.
OL,18,FThe team of 10 spoke to key groups
OL,19,Finvolved, attended hustings meetings
OL,20,Fand were present at polling stations
OL,21,Fand counts.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
FL,451,445,260,140,0,100
