OL,3,GNEWSAElection observers saw 'amazing
OL,4,Asense of civic duty'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBlinn said the "non-governmental,
OL,7,Fnon-political" mission had witnessed a
OL,8,F"very well-handled" election.
